{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04008.SBN#0001", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04008.SBN", "offset": 753, "capacity": 62, "raw_hex": "f5c2f16bf8e7f25ef374f0b2f1b2f1c781432f2ff3f0f1d8f9aef369f36df8b2f473f0eff0a5f29ef0a9f7d12f2ff0adf0aef0af8143f273f274f0af8148", "baseline_text": "쌍무를 움직이려면，//엄청난 영력이 필요하겠군…//마리아，괜찮아？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "双武を動かすには、//すさまじい霊力が必要だな……//マリア、大丈夫か？", "pointer_offset": 632, "unit": "dialogue:0ea47803a5ced414", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04008.SBN#0002", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04008.SBN", "offset": 822, "capacity": 48, "raw_hex": "f0f08143f273f274f0cef0b8f0cf81442f2ff8dff266f18ef0f32f2ff0a5f8a4f287f0a2f346f8f4f577f0b8f0cf8144", "baseline_text": "네，괜찮습니다．//제 걱정은//하지 않으셔도 됩니다．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "はい、大丈夫です。//私のことは、//心配ご無用です。", "pointer_offset": 636, "unit": "dialogue:2eee4d59f39ab957", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04008.SBN#0003", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04008.SBN", "offset": 873, "capacity": 48, "raw_hex": "f0e2f0e4f27af8b9f0c0f0a5f1c7f7d12f2ff8b2f18ef0f4f15781432f2ff0aff16bf299f8f4f0aff383f0b8f0cf8144", "baseline_text": "대장님에 비하면…//이 정도는，//아무것도 아닙니다．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "隊長にくらべたら……//この程度のことは、//なんでもありません。", "pointer_offset": 640, "unit": "dialogue:cfb467b4957a6df9", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04008.SBN#0004", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04008.SBN", "offset": 2123, "capacity": 38, "raw_hex": "f253f957f2b6f0dff0b181432f2ff0e2f0e4f27af8c8f0e1f0a4f94bf14cf0cef0b8f0cff7d1", "baseline_text": "저는 언제나，//대장님을 의지해 왔습니다…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "私はいつも、//隊長を頼っていました……", "pointer_offset": 644, "unit": "dialogue:630be5e89507f038", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04008.SBN#0005", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04008.SBN", "offset": 975, "capacity": 48, "raw_hex": "f0d8f0aef984f0e2f0e4f27af0f3f7d12f2ff263f1b5f8b2f8dff484f0b22f2ff243f95af1e2f246f0cef0b8f0cff7d1", "baseline_text": "그리고 대장님은…//말없이 제 힘이//되어 주셨습니다…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "そして、隊長は……//黙って私の力に//なってくれていました……", "pointer_offset": 648, "unit": "dialogue:5389ce144a6893cc", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04008.SBN#0006", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04008.SBN", "offset": 1036, "capacity": 30, "raw_hex": "f8d8f784f8f3f357f0c8f7d12f2ff19cf95af1e2f246f0cef0b8f0cff7d1", "baseline_text": "그 넓은 등을…//내어 주셨습니다…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "その広い背中を……//貸してくれていたんです……", "pointer_offset": 652, "unit": "dialogue:aed9eca1fdb5136c", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04008.SBN#0007", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04008.SBN", "offset": 2164, "capacity": 56, "raw_hex": "f0d8f143f947f0b2f248f0b9f957f0dff14481432f2ff0e2f0e4f27af8c8f490f984f2bff0cff184f7d12f2ff0c6f0f7f0d7f0b8f0cf8144", "baseline_text": "그래서 이번에는 제가，//대장님을 돕고 싶다고…//생각합니다．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "だから……今度は私が、//隊長を助けたいと……//そう思います。", "pointer_offset": 656, "unit": "dialogue:142aedc6cf2565a8", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04008.SBN#0008", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04008.SBN", "offset": 1144, "capacity": 8, "raw_hex": "f0adf0aef0aff7d1", "baseline_text": "마리아…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "マリア……", "pointer_offset": 660, "unit": "dialogue:da49e81b05491d5b", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04008.SBN#0009", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04008.SBN", "offset": 1155, "capacity": 18, "raw_hex": "f2b0f984f154f15a8143f0adf0aef0af8144", "baseline_text": "믿고 있어，마리아．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "頼りにしてるよ……マリア。", "pointer_offset": 664, "unit": "dialogue:861066d987a2e795", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04008.SBN#0010", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04008.SBN", "offset": 1182, "capacity": 24, "raw_hex": "f0b1f0b9f0f18143f0d8fa6ff0faf164f8f3f1b5f15a8144", "baseline_text": "나에게，그럴 자격은 없어．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "俺に、そんな資格はないよ。", "pointer_offset": 668, "unit": "dialogue:df45b9fa8176649e", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04008.SBN#0011", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04008.SBN", "offset": 1209, "capacity": 18, "raw_hex": "f2b0f984f154f15a8143f0adf0aef0af8144", "baseline_text": "믿고 있어，마리아．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "頼りにしてるよ……マリア。", "pointer_offset": 672, "unit": "dialogue:861066d987a2e795", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04008.SBN#0012", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04008.SBN", "offset": 1236, "capacity": 8, "raw_hex": "f0e2f0e4f27af7d1", "baseline_text": "대장님…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "隊長……", "pointer_offset": 676, "unit": "dialogue:62f89a7ac3998ed5", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04008.SBN#0013", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04008.SBN", "offset": 1245, "capacity": 50, "raw_hex": "f0d8f0aef184f7d12f2ff0b2fa62f357f0b2f0a8f8f4f273f274f0cff1c781432f2ff2b6f0dffac0f48ef1b2f285f0f18144", "baseline_text": "그리고…//이런 등이라도 괜찮다면，//언제든 빌려줄게．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "それと……//こんな背中でよければ、//いつでも貸すよ。", "pointer_offset": 680, "unit": "dialogue:7f1dc0c430c7fdf3", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04008.SBN#0014", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04008.SBN", "offset": 1298, "capacity": 52, "raw_hex": "f1adf2cef2cef7d1f0d8facaf0e2f0e4f27af0f42f2ff0a4f1d9f246f8c8f16ef15781432f2ff263f277f94bf1e2f1d5f0ef8144", "baseline_text": "우후후…그럼 대장님도//지치셨을 때는，//말씀해 주세요．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "うふふ……では隊長も//つかれたときは、//おっしゃってくださいね。", "pointer_offset": 684, "unit": "dialogue:d29d34b8b19e9d24", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04008.SBN#0015", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04008.SBN", "offset": 1363, "capacity": 42, "raw_hex": "f8dff357f8b2f273f274f0cff1c781432f2ff2b6f0dffac0f48ef9b2f186fa7cf2aff0b8f261f0ef8144", "baseline_text": "제 등이 괜찮다면，//언제든 빌려 드릴 테니까요．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "私の背中でよければ、//いつでもお貸ししますからね。", "pointer_offset": 688, "unit": "dialogue:cee1d53a7428e20f", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04008.SBN#0016", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04008.SBN", "offset": 1414, "capacity": 26, "raw_hex": "f184f0adf1c981442f2ff0d8f16ef957f293f35cf257f0f18144", "baseline_text": "고마워．//그때는 부탁할게．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ありがとう。//その時は頼むよ。", "pointer_offset": 692, "unit": "dialogue:9d3e30785bf0a1ea", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04008.SBN#0017", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04008.SBN", "offset": 1445, "capacity": 58, "raw_hex": "f0b1f0b9f0f18143f0d8fa6ff0faf164f8f3f1b5f15af7d12f2ff2b6f0dff8b1f0f4f25ef9d4f0f2f984f154f0a2f0b8fa61f263f0b2f1488144", "baseline_text": "나에게，그럴 자격은 없어…//언제나 도움만 받고 있으니까 말이야．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "俺に、そんな資格はないよ……//いつも助けられてばかりだしさ。", "pointer_offset": 696, "unit": "dialogue:803759b0b8cab670", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04008.SBN#0018", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04008.SBN", "offset": 1506, "capacity": 26, "raw_hex": "f0e2f0e4f27af7d12f2ff0d8fa62fa8af0aff383f0b8f0cf8144", "baseline_text": "대장님…//그런 건 아닙니다．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "隊長……//そんなことはありませんよ。", "pointer_offset": 700, "unit": "dialogue:b4f05e197af1f4d8", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04008.SBN#0019", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04008.SBN", "offset": 1543, "capacity": 62, "raw_hex": "f0dff162f163f164f965f1bef0c7f1cef0f4f7d12f2ff174f0aef163f164f965f1bef0c7f1cef0f4f7d12f2ff0adf2c3f8f3f0a5f0b1f149f0b8f0cf8144", "baseline_text": "제국화격단 여러분도…//파리화격단 여러분도…//마음은 하나입니다．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "帝国華撃団のみんなも……//巴里華撃団のみんなも……//想いはひとつです。", "pointer_offset": 704, "unit": "dialogue:45d9fc0aad124995", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04008.SBN#0020", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04008.SBN", "offset": 2229, "capacity": 42, "raw_hex": "f0e2f0e4f27af960f484f8b2f243f984f2bff0cff1842f2ff0c6f0f7f0a5f984f154f0cef0b8f0cf8144", "baseline_text": "대장님께 힘이 되고 싶다고//생각하고 있습니다．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "隊長の力になりたいと、//そう思っているんです。", "pointer_offset": 708, "unit": "dialogue:ca5f8073cdb32b81", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04008.SBN#0021", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04008.SBN", "offset": 1661, "capacity": 26, "raw_hex": "f0d8f299f1d4f0f3f7d12f2ff2c9f8aff1e2f367f0bcf0b58144", "baseline_text": "그것만은…//알아 주십시오．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "それだけは……//わかってください。", "pointer_offset": 712, "unit": "dialogue:6db2a9fa585950f5", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04008.SBN#0022", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04008.SBN", "offset": 1696, "capacity": 46, "raw_hex": "f0aff0af8143f2c9f2e9f15a8143f0adf0aef0af81442f2ff271f0f9f8e1f484f0c8f7d12f2ff48ef27cf0f181b8", "baseline_text": "아아，알았어，마리아．//모두의 힘을…//빌릴게∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ああ、わかったよ、マリア。//みんなの力……//貸してもらうぞ！", "pointer_offset": 716, "unit": "dialogue:5ed4155cec389dc3", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04008.SBN#0023", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04008.SBN", "offset": 2278, "capacity": 38, "raw_hex": "f2c9f29ef0cef0b8f0cf81442f2ff0fa8143f2aaf240f8c8f19cf9b2f1e2f367f0bcf0b581b8", "baseline_text": "알겠습니다．//자，명령을 내려 주십시오∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "了解です。//さあ、命令をどうぞ！", "pointer_offset": 720, "unit": "dialogue:3922b73353a54de5", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04008.SBN#0024", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04008.SBN", "offset": 1790, "capacity": 8, "raw_hex": "8163816381638163", "baseline_text": "…………", "kind": "ascr", "source": "…………", "pointer_offset": 724, "unit": "dialogue:b5999fb8c439aedc", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04008.SBN#0025", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04008.SBN", "offset": 1799, "capacity": 64, "raw_hex": "f0e28143f0e2f0e4f27af7d12f2ff0b2fa62f26af352f0b9f947f3a3f594f0a5f0bcf1c781432f2ff253f14ff7d1fa64f293f294f0def0cef0b8f0cff1d4f7d1", "baseline_text": "대，대장님…//이런 상황에서 침묵하시면，//저기…좀 부끄럽습니다만…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "た、隊長……//こんな時に黙られると、//あの……恥ずかしいんですが……", "pointer_offset": 728, "unit": "dialogue:53b02c44ab50004e", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04008.SBN#0026", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04008.SBN", "offset": 1868, "capacity": 52, "raw_hex": "f0a5f0a5f0a5f7d1f0b5f4c1f1d4f0b981432f2ff0adf0aef0aff8e1f0d8fa62f28df28ef0c82f2ff1acf984f2bff1f3f15a8144", "baseline_text": "하하하…오랜만에，//마리아의 그런 얼굴을//보고 싶었어．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ははは……ひさしぶりに、//マリアのそういう顔が//見たかったんだ。", "pointer_offset": 732, "unit": "dialogue:9c9d080adaabbb79", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04008.SBN#0027", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04008.SBN", "offset": 1933, "capacity": 54, "raw_hex": "f0e2f0e4f27a8143f0d8fa62f9ccf16ef146f0b9f7d12f2ff1ccf293f8c7f0aff96bf263f8f4f991f0a5f246f955f28af144f0ef8148", "baseline_text": "대장님，그런 일 때문에…//일부러 아무 말도 안 하셨던 건가요？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "隊長、そんなことのために……//わざと黙ってたんですか？", "pointer_offset": 736, "unit": "dialogue:3a2854e172d7e4ea", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04008.SBN#0028", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04008.SBN", "offset": 1988, "capacity": 68, "raw_hex": "f0abf191f0abf19181442f2ff0a5f0a4f9d4f1c5f97bf9f7f1ccf8a3f1a0f14ff944f0c6f3bbf15af7d12f2ff8d8f0abf18ff8e7f0a4fc83f19cf984f263f29ef15a81b8", "baseline_text": "미안미안．//하지만 방금 전 일로 용기가 생겼어…//그 미소를 지켜 내고 말겠어∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ごめんごめん。//でも、今ので勇気が出た……//その笑顔を守ってみせるさ！", "pointer_offset": 740, "unit": "dialogue:05084e0c663d986d", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04008.SBN#0029", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04008.SBN", "offset": 2059, "capacity": 48, "raw_hex": "f18ef263f0b2f0a4f7d12f2ff0b2f0df8143f3a7f0a8f0ef81b82f2ff0ad8143f0adf2c3f0e2f8a3f0a5f1d5f0ef81b8", "baseline_text": "정말이지…//이제，몰라요∈//마，마음대로 하세요∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "まったく……//もう、知りません！//か、勝手にしてください！", "pointer_offset": 744, "unit": "dialogue:22cf56b28c1750f6", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04008.SBN#0030", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04008.SBN", "offset": 2118, "capacity": 4, "raw_hex": "6d61696e", "baseline_text": "main", "kind": "ascr", "source": "main", "pointer_offset": 748, "unit": "dialogue:0d6e4079e36703eb", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
